Z||000004||Black88GT||12-10-2000||11:28 AM||||Out of curiousity's sake, how much was it for?<P>I was going to say "If it's a lot of money, I would post his name", but now that I think about it, a lot to me might not be a lot to you and vice versa.  SO, if you consider it a lot of money, I would post his name.  I don't anyone would really bash him or anything, unless he refuses to pay.  This would also help people possibly buying from or selling to this guy.  I just hope its not one of my friends then I will really be putting my foot in my mouth.<P>IMHO <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
